{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026JBMiRv99VN1793448651.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>萬聖節前夕，本港多處都有活動，其中中環蘭桂坊已實施人潮管制，要分批進入，警方指蘭桂坊一帶已非常擠迫，呼籲轉去其他地區慶祝。</p><p></p><p>晚上七時許，已有大批人聚集在蘭桂坊的外圍，跟從警方指示，分批沿德己立街進入。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.LKF-2000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263aIyvZYNdw1793448660.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>滿身大汗入到核心區，妝容無變，心情都不變，這位不是行到出煙，純粹造型設定，鏡頭前專業十足。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.LKF-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026BHLYIoNM1g1793448676.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>蘭桂坊下午起人流開始增多，商戶估計單日生意額會再創新高。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:36.984348+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T12:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.797689+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.622136+00:00","content_hash":"7c7582bf0e1231e22b75dd776d503b50096eadb453585b620fd40c8fbb4c470d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:36.984348+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}